<?php

/**
 * @file
 * Retiring shell for Books - Book Management.
 *
 * The hooks and services this module used to provide now live in
 * books_catalog, books_cover and books_hardcover. Only the update-hook history
 * in the .install file keeps this module installed.
 *
 * It deliberately declares no services. An alias to a service in one of the
 * new modules would break the container rebuild that runs before
 * config:import during a deploy, because those modules are not installed yet
 * at that point.
 */
